      "content": "i feel like i'm disappearing. i forgot my sisters birthday yesterday... and i couldn't even remember the word for \"refrigerator\" for like five minutes. it's like my mind is just leaking out of me. i'm scared that one day i'll just wake up and there won't be anything left of \"me\" inside anymore. just a shell.",
